@@ -8,6 +8,20 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- Tool input rejection diagnostics use consistent field paths and constraint wording across validator module versions.
+
+- Invalid tool input now emits a warning naming the failed field and constraint without including its value.
+
+- Tool schema validation uses the CommonJS default constructor so native ESM consumers do not require an Ajv named export.
+
+- Tool schema validation reuses compiled validators for static tools and repeated dynamic schema objects.
+
+- Tool calls missing required input now return a schema rejection to the model before the executor runs.
+
+- Registering a tool with an invalid static JSON input schema now fails immediately with an error naming the tool.
+
